# Waveshare USB-CAN-A: the adapter is a CH340 USB-serial chip (idVendor
# 1a86, idProduct 7523) with an STM32 behind it. CH340 exposes no serial
# number, so this rule cannot distinguish this adapter from any other
# CH340-based USB-serial device (Arduino clones, other dongles, ...) on the
# same idVendor/idProduct pair — if you have more than one CH340 device
# plugged in, this will fire for all of them.
#
# Starts an aa55cand@<ttyname>.service instance for every matching tty node.
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1a86", ATTRS{idProduct}=="7523", TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="aa55cand@%k.service"
